			icon: "valley:firewood_bundle"
			description: ["Oda, not looking up from the ledger: \"Four houses, sixteen bundles each. That is sixty-four, which is exactly what you were given.\"", "", "Put 16 &aFirewood Bundles&r into each of the four marked stacks in the inn's back room. Sixty-four is what Oda gave you and sixty-four is what winter costs — burn any of it and you are cutting more.", "", "Each of them gives something back, and Wisp lights a lantern path down the frozen river."]
