		{
			id: "13FC9DEDA582A29C"
			title: "Duct the Coolant Loop to the Town"
			subtitle: "Josie's rule: the heat goes to the town."
			icon: "thermal:fluid_duct"
			description: ["Josie, in her own hand: \"The waste heat goes to the town, not the sky. Anything else is a fire you paid for twice.\"", "", "Run &aFluid Duct&r and &aEnergy Duct&r from the reactor to the six greenhouse heaters on the square, and to the bathhouse tank behind the inn.", "", "Six heaters come up warm, the tank steams, and the glass lights itself."]
